    "share_count_basis": "Fully diluted at the latest count: 528.82m common shares outstanding (10-Q cover, 27 Oct 2026; same as 30 Sep 2026 balance sheet) + 3.25m OP units + 0.53m restricted stock + 1.2m treasury-method dilution from 9.1m unsettled forward-sale shares (Q3-2026 EPS note). Held FLAT: SBC is expensed in the flow, and external growth funded by new ATM equity is assumed value-neutral and excluded from the growth path.",
